## **Task 3 — 
Perform Sample Registration**  

### **Objective**  
Automate full registration and verify redirect.  
The assignment states:  
> “Wait until the URL contains 'registered=true'… Capture the current URL after registration.” 

### **Approach**  
1. Open registration page  
2. Apply explicit wait  
3. Fill all fields  
4. Select dropdown values:  
   - Country → India  
   - Account Type → Engineer  
5. Enter email + password  
6. Click Sign Up  
7. Wait for URL change  
8. Capture final URL

### **Expected Result**  
> “Redirected URL: `https://practice.qabrains.com/registration?registered=true”` [(practice.qabrains.com in Bing)](https://www.bing.com/search?q="https%3A%2F%2Fpractice.qabrains.com%2Fregistration%3Fregistered%3Dtrue%25E2%2580%259D") 

